abstract: >-
  Certified Workflow Conversion is an evidence-bound, fail-closed Python toolkit
  for diagnosing bottlenecks and reporting conservative lower-bound throughput in
  long-running AI agent workflows. It does not certify factual truth, model
  intelligence, or production safety; it reports procedural admissibility under
  declared evidence, contracts, witnesses, and checks.
